/T (Fully Connected \(Dense\) Layer  After the series of Conv+Pool layers, the 3D feature maps are flattened into a 1D vector and passed to one or more fully connected \(Dense\) layers. These are identical to standard ANN layers every neuron connects to every neuron in the next layer.  The FC layers act as the classifier, combining all the extracted spatial features to make the final  prediction. The last layer uses a Softmax activation for multi-class classification, producing a probability  distribution over the output classes. )
/E (Fully Connected \(Dense\) Layer  After the series of Conv+Pool layers, the 3D feature maps are flattened into a 1D vector and passed to one or more fully connected \(Dense\) layers. These are identical to standard ANN layers every neuron connects to every neuron in the next layer.  The FC layers act as the classifier, combining all the extracted spatial features to make the final  prediction. The last layer uses a Softmax activation for multi-class classification, producing a probability  distribution over the output classes. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
